{"unit_id": "tag:077K:title", "translation": "Gabber 的结果", "allowed_english": ["Gabber"], "term_occurrences": [], "unknown_terms": [], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:077K:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节证明 Gabber 的一个结果。该结果保证，对每个概形（scheme），都存在一个基数（cardinal）<MATH_0001>，使得每个拟（quasi）凝聚模（coherent module）<MATH_0002>都是其拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0003>生成（generated）子层（subsheaves）的并（union）。由此可知，一个概形（scheme）上的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）所成的范畴（category）是一个具有极限（limits）和足够多的内射对象（enough injectives）的 Grothendieck 阿贝尔范畴（abelian category）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>Akhil Mathew 在一篇<TEXTOPEN_0001>博客文章<TEXTCLOSE_0001>中对此作了很好的说明。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["Gabber", "Grothendieck", "Akhil", "Mathew"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "cardinal", "target_term": "基数"}, {"source_term": "quasi", "target_term": "拟"}, {"source_term": "coherent module", "target_term": "凝聚模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "subsheaves", "target_term": "子层"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "limits", "target_term": "极限"}, {"source_term": "enough injectives", "target_term": "足够多的内射对象"}, {"source_term": "abelian category", "target_term": "阿贝尔范畴"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "结果所适用的几何对象。"}, {"source_term": "cardinal", "target_term": "基数", "context": "控制生成所用的大小。"}, {"source_term": "quasi", "target_term": "拟", "context": "保留模的性质中的限定前缀，与随后同处的术语连读为拟凝聚模。"}, {"source_term": "coherent module", "target_term": "凝聚模", "context": "此处原文带 quasi- 前缀，连读所得到的术语是拟凝聚模。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "修饰用于取并的子层。"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "指子层满足给定基数的生成条件。"}, {"source_term": "subsheaves", "target_term": "子层", "context": "组成所述模的子对象。"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并", "context": "由子层组成原模的运算。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所述层所在的空间。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "所述范畴的对象。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "由所述层构成的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "limits", "target_term": "极限", "context": "该范畴所具有的极限。"}, {"source_term": "enough injectives", "target_term": "足够多的内射对象", "context": "描述该阿贝尔范畴中内射对象的存在性条件。"}, {"source_term": "abelian category", "target_term": "阿贝尔范畴", "context": "与 Grothendieck 一同描述所得到的范畴。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:077L:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为赋环空间（ringed space）。设<MATH_0002>为无限（infinite）基数（cardinal）。称<MATH_0003>模（modules）的层（sheaf）<MATH_0004>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0005>生成（generated）的<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若存在一个开（open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0006>，使得<MATH_0007>由某个子集（subset）<MATH_0008>生成（generated），且其基数（cardinality）至多为<MATH_0009>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ringed space", "target_term": "赋环空间"}, {"source_term": "infinite", "target_term": "无限"}, {"source_term": "cardinal", "target_term": "基数"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "cardinality", "target_term": "基数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "ringed space", "target_term": "赋环空间", "context": "定义所用的基空间。"}, {"source_term": "infinite", "target_term": "无限", "context": "限定定义中的基数。"}, {"source_term": "cardinal", "target_term": "基数", "context": "给出生成所需的大小上界。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "所述层取值的模。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "定义所讨论的对象。"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "定义带指定基数的生成条件。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "限定覆盖由开集给出。"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "用以表述局部生成条件。"}, {"source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集", "context": "供局部生成使用的子集。"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "描述所述子集与被生成对象的关系。"}, {"source_term": "cardinality", "target_term": "基数", "context": "用以表述子集大小的上界。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:077K:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，至多<MATH_0001>个<MATH_0002>生成（generated）的模（modules）的直和（direct sum）仍是<MATH_0003>生成（generated）的，因为<MATH_0004>，见《集合（Sets）》第<REF_0001>节。特别地，两个<MATH_0005>生成（generated）的模（modules）的直和（direct sum）也满足这一结论。此外，<MATH_0006>生成（generated）的层（sheaf）的商（quotient）是<MATH_0007>生成（generated）的。（但对子模（submodules），同样的结论未必成立。）\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "direct sum", "target_term": "直和"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "Sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "direct sum", "target_term": "直和"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "submodules", "target_term": "子模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "限定取直和的模。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "所取直和的各个对象。"}, {"source_term": "direct sum", "target_term": "直和", "context": "适用于至多给定个数的模的运算。"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "描述直和仍满足的生成条件。"}, {"source_term": "Sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "所引章节的名称。"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "限定两项直和中的模。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "两项直和的两个对象。"}, {"source_term": "direct sum", "target_term": "直和", "context": "将同一结论应用于两个模。"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "限定取商之前的层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "取商的对象。"}, {"source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商", "context": "满足同样生成条件的商对象。"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "描述商仍满足的生成条件。"}, {"source_term": "submodules", "target_term": "子模", "context": "同样结论未必成立的子对象。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:077M:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为赋环空间（ringed space）。设<MATH_0002>为基数（cardinal）。存在一个集合（set）<MATH_0003>和一族（family）<MATH_0004>，其中各项均为<MATH_0005>生成（generated）的<MATH_0006>模（modules），使得每个<MATH_0007>生成（generated）的<MATH_0008>模（module）都同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0009>中的一个。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ringed space", "target_term": "赋环空间"}, {"source_term": "cardinal", "target_term": "基数"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "ringed space", "target_term": "赋环空间", "context": "引理所讨论的基空间。"}, {"source_term": "cardinal", "target_term": "基数", "context": "用于规定生成条件。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "引理断言存在的集合。"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族", "context": "由满足给定生成条件的模组成。"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "限定该族的各个成员。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "组成该族的对象。"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "限定要与族中成员比较的模。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "要与族中成员比较的对象。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "任意这样的模与族中某项的关系。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:077M:proof", "translation": "<MATH_0001>的覆盖（coverings）构成一个集合（set）（前提是不允许重复）。设<MATH_0002>是一个覆盖（covering），并设<MATH_0003>是一个<MATH_0004>模（module）。那么，存在一个集合（set），其中的同构类（isomorphism classes）由满足下述条件的<MATH_0005>模（modules）<MATH_0006>给出，条件是<MATH_0007>。这是因为粘合（glueing）映射（maps）构成一个集合（set）。这样，只需证明存在一个集合（set），其元素为商（quotients）<MATH_0008>（的同构类（isomorphism classes）），其中<MATH_0009>是任意赋环空间（ringed space）。这一点很清楚。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism classes", "target_term": "同构类"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "quotients", "target_term": "商"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism classes", "target_term": "同构类"}, {"source_term": "ringed space", "target_term": "赋环空间"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "考虑该空间上的所有覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "所述覆盖组成集合。"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "固定其中的一个覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "证明中预先给定的对象。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "满足条件的同构类构成的集合。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism classes", "target_term": "同构类", "context": "将满足条件的模按同构归类。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "按所述性质筛选的对象。"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "描述用来确定所得对象的映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "粘合所用的映射。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "粘合映射所成的集合。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "约化后只须证明存在的集合。"}, {"source_term": "quotients", "target_term": "商", "context": "约化后的证明所考察的对象。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism classes", "target_term": "同构类", "context": "将这些商按同构归类。"}, {"source_term": "ringed space", "target_term": "赋环空间", "context": "约化后的断言适用的任意基空间。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:077K:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n以下是本节标题所指的结果。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [], "unknown_terms": [], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:077N:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。存在一个基数（cardinal）<MATH_0002>，使得每个拟（quasi）凝聚模（coherent module）<MATH_0003>都是其拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0004>生成（generated）子模（submodules）的有向余极限（directed colimit）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "cardinal", "target_term": "基数"}, {"source_term": "quasi", "target_term": "拟"}, {"source_term": "coherent module", "target_term": "凝聚模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "submodules", "target_term": "子模"}, {"source_term": "directed colimit", "target_term": "有向余极限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "结果所适用的基空间。"}, {"source_term": "cardinal", "target_term": "基数", "context": "用于统一限定子模的生成条件。"}, {"source_term": "quasi", "target_term": "拟", "context": "保留模的性质中的限定前缀，与随后同处的术语连读为拟凝聚模。"}, {"source_term": "coherent module", "target_term": "凝聚模", "context": "此处原文带 quasi- 前缀，连读所得到的术语是拟凝聚模。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "限定用于形成余极限的子模。"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "描述子模满足给定基数的生成条件。"}, {"source_term": "submodules", "target_term": "子模", "context": "作为余极限所用的子对象。"}, {"source_term": "directed colimit", "target_term": "有向余极限", "context": "由所述子模得到原模的余极限。"}], "notes": []}
